        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Ryan Merchant, Sebu Simonian, Chris Vrenna, Spencer Ludwig\n- Organizations: Capital Cities, Tweaker, Nine Inch Nails\n- Places: Los Angeles, California\n- Topics: indie pop, alternative rock, solo projects\n\nFacts:\n- Tweaker is an American alternative rock collaboration founded by Chris Vrenna in the late 1990s.\n- Capital Cities is an American indie pop duo from Los Angeles, California, formed in 2010 by Ryan Merchant and Sebu Simonian.\n- Ryan Merchant performs vocals, keyboard, and guitar in Capital Cities.\n- Sebu Simonian performs vocals and keyboard in Capital Cities.\n- Spencer Ludwig is a former member of Capital Cities.\n- The Attraction to All Things Uncertain is the first solo effort by Tweaker, also known as Chris Vrenna.\n- Chris Vrenna is a former member of Nine Inch Nails.",
